### Search employees by name
GET http://localhost:8081/employees/search/Rah

### Search with different case
GET http://localhost:8081/employees/search/rah

### Search nonexistent name
GET http://localhost:8081/employees/search/XYZABC

### Create Engineering
POST http://localhost:8081/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Engineering"
}

### Create HR
POST http://localhost:8081/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Human Resources"
}

### Create Finance
POST http://localhost:8081/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Finance"
}

### Get all departments
GET http://localhost:8081/departments

### Search departments
GET http://localhost:8081/departments/3

### Update department
PUT http://localhost:8081/departments/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Finance"
}